# Env-key manifest for the HomeIQ stack (TAP-5902). Names only — NEVER values.
#
# scripts/preflight-env.sh checks the root .env against this file before the
# stack starts. `required` keys must be present AND non-empty, or the deploy
# fails loudly with the missing names. `conditional` keys back a single feed
# or integration: an empty one produces a warning, not a failure, because the
# feed degrades to standby (the /ready split from TAP-5903 is what surfaces
# that at runtime).
#
# Format: KEY<TAB>required|conditional<TAB>one-line reason
# History: the 2026-08-01 HA migration silently dropped 55 populated keys.
# Nothing failed loudly for ten days. This manifest is the diff-able artifact
# that makes the next rewrite reviewable.
#
# DASHBOARD_API_KEY is deliberately absent: compose derives it from API_KEY
# (core-platform compose, dashboard block), so API_KEY is the key to guard.
# WEATHER_API_KEY is deliberately absent: weather-api moved to the keyless
# Open-Meteo provider (PR #79).

HOME_ASSISTANT_URL	required	HA REST base URL — every HA-facing service
HOME_ASSISTANT_TOKEN	required	HA long-lived token (legacy name, still consumed)
HA_HTTP_URL	required	HA REST base URL (current name)
HA_WS_URL	required	HA WebSocket URL
HA_TOKEN	required	HA long-lived token (current name)
INFLUXDB_TOKEN	required	event store auth — all collectors and query APIs
POSTGRES_USER	required	relational store auth
POSTGRES_PASSWORD	required	relational store auth
API_KEY	required	shared service-to-service API key (data-api, admin-api, device-intelligence, nginx injection)
AGENTFORGE_API_KEY	required	AgentForge project bearer — its loss killed the integration for ten days
WATTTIME_USERNAME	conditional	carbon-intensity feed
WATTTIME_PASSWORD	conditional	carbon-intensity feed
WATTTIME_API_TOKEN	conditional	carbon-intensity feed
NABU_CASA_URL	conditional	remote HA access
NABU_CASA_TOKEN	conditional	remote HA access
MQTT_BROKER	conditional	MQTT integration
MQTT_USERNAME	conditional	MQTT integration
MQTT_PASSWORD	conditional	MQTT integration
CALENDAR_ENTITIES	conditional	calendar feed entity list
